### Add Project
POST {{host}}/api/v3/projects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token1}}

{
    "project": "{{newProject}}",
    "locales":[
      { "locale":"zh-TW" },
      { "locale":"en-US" },
      { "locale":"zh-HK" },
      { "locale":"ms-MY" },
      { "locale":"zh-CN" },
      { "locale":"ja-JP" },
      { "locale":"th-TH" }
   ]
}

### Sync Project
POST {{host}}/api/v3/projects/EVoucherService/sync
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

### Delete Project

DELETE {{host}}/api/v3/projects/695e2a48d23d0c00076b873f
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token1}}

### get GetProjects
GET {{host}}/api/v3/projects

### get project
GET {{host}}/api/v3/projects/{{newProject}}

#["System","ToBeVerified","Team","Page","Epic"]



### sync project
POST {{host}}/api/v3/projects/{{project}}/sync
Content-Type: application/json